{
  "name": "Email certificate PDFs from Google Forms with Sheets, Orshot and Gmail",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "58571e6d-1464-55fe-9142-5d542abee948",
      "name": "Watch new form responses",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {},
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1a12bc86-8f64-5fd6-b2af-4e77f419f3f8",
      "name": "Configure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e56482a9-99d8-5f47-9e9d-ef93b7385020",
              "name": "recipient_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json['Full name'] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "f7669a3d-e69e-5470-af39-da168d1ab324",
              "name": "recipient_email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json['Email address'] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "9d165500-884c-53bf-9a9b-14934e20f687",
              "name": "course_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your course name"
            },
            {
              "id": "be31f3db-721e-5d82-9cc0-c97a360895fe",
              "name": "issue_date",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('dd LLLL yyyy') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "57b174ad-1d6e-55db-a461-f647349ec32c",
              "name": "email_subject",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your certificate is ready"
            },
            {
              "id": "cd09a14e-7353-5a50-9636-5e90ce36234b",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your organization"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "a36277d2-e11b-5507-8638-dbad78cd4f7a",
      "name": "Render certificate PDF with Orshot",
      "type": "@thelifeofrishi/n8n-nodes-orshot.orshot",
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "operation": "https://api.orshot.com/v1/studio/render",
        "responseType": "binary",
        "responseFormat": "pdf",
        "studioTemplateId": "",
        "studioModifications": {
          "modification": [
            {
              "key": "candidateName",
              "value": "={{ $json.recipient_name }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "courseName",
              "value": "={{ $json.course_name }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "issueDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.issue_date }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "6351bd74-4b54-5d02-afed-414b44134a93",
      "name": "Email certificate with Gmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Configure').item.json.recipient_email }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Configure').item.json.recipient_name }},\n\nThanks for completing {{ $('Configure').item.json.course_name }}. Your certificate is attached.\n\n{{ $('Configure').item.json.sender_name }}",
        "options": {
          "senderName": "={{ $('Configure').item.json.sender_name }}",
          "attachmentsUi": {
            "attachmentsBinary": [
              {
                "property": "data"
              }
            ]
          },
          "appendAttribution": false
        },
        "subject": "={{ $('Configure').item.json.email_subject }}",
        "emailType": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "59adf068-c65d-54df-9b0e-767a58eaf969",
      "name": "Template overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -620,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 1140,
        "content": "# Email certificate PDFs from Google Forms with Sheets, Orshot and Gmail\n\nSend a personalized certificate PDF to everyone who fills in your Google Form. Orshot renders the PDF from your certificate template and Gmail emails it as an attachment.\n\n### Who's it for\n- Course creators, trainers and event organizers\n- Anyone who hands out certificates of completion or attendance\n\n### How it works\n- Google Forms saves each response to a linked Google Sheet\n- The Google Sheets trigger picks up each new response row\n- **Configure** maps the name and email columns and sets the course name\n- The Orshot node renders the certificate as a PDF file\n- Gmail sends the PDF to the person who submitted the form\n\n### Setup\n- In Google Forms, open Responses and link the form to a Google Sheet\n- Add Google Sheets, Orshot and Gmail credentials\n- Select the response sheet in the trigger\n- Pick your certificate template in the Orshot node\n- Update the column names and course details in **Configure**\n- Full guide: [Automate certificates from Google Sheets](https://orshot.com/blog/google-sheets-certificates-automation)\n- Product page: [Orshot PDF API](https://orshot.com/solutions/pdf-generation-api)\n\n### Requirements\n- Orshot account (the Orshot node is verified, so it runs on n8n Cloud)\n- Google Forms with a linked response sheet\n- Gmail account\n\n### Customization tips\n- Add more template fields, such as score or instructor name\n- Change the response format to PNG to send an image badge instead of a PDF\n- Write the PDF URL back to the sheet instead of emailing it"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "441bfe08-112f-5cb9-80cf-770d0d3bbd06",
      "name": "Step 1 note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 1. New response\nLink your Google Form to a sheet, then select that sheet here. **Configure** maps the `Full name` and `Email address` columns. Rename them to match your form questions."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "17cd8cbc-bede-5ac8-8ca5-dd4519dc29a9",
      "name": "Step 2 note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        460,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 2. Render and email\nThe Orshot node renders your certificate template as a PDF file. Gmail sends it as an attachment. Keys must match the parameter IDs in your template."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Configure": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Render certificate PDF with Orshot",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Watch new form responses": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Render certificate PDF with Orshot": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email certificate with Gmail",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}